<%#
  Renders nothing. Every Peerwatch page calls it, so a host can fit the pages
  into its own navigation (breadcrumbs, active sidebar item) by overriding
  this one file: bin/rails g peerwatch:views -v chrome

  Locals:
    section  :dashboard or :peers
    title    such as "Peerwatch · Peers", already set as content_for(:title)
    crumbs   [[label, path_or_nil], ...] from "Peerwatch" to this page; the
             last one has no path

  Examples: "Making it look native" in docs/INSTALLATION.md.
%>
